==Strategy==
Although there are [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angels]] here, there is no need to bring [[:Category:Anti-Angel Cats|Anti-Angel Cats]] (except good generalists like [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] or [[The Grateful Crane (Uber Rare Cat)|Supernova Cosmo]]) because the Angels pose no threat in this stage at all. First, kill the Heavenly Hippoe with [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] for money, then lure and obliterate Cyberhorn with [[Cossack Cat (Rare Cat)|Royal Guard Cat]]. Once Cyberhorn is dead, try to quickly kill Lowkey with the aforementioned Royal Guard Cat and [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi:NX]] before Oldhorn appears, if you can't, it's fine, since you can just pile on your anti-Relics on Oldhorn instead. Once Lowkey and Oldhorn are both dead, kill I.M. Phace with [[Talents|Talented]] [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]], [[Master of Logic Newtone (Special Cat)|Master of Logic Mewtone]] as well as other anti-Alien Cats like [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]], once I.M. Phace is dead, there are no more threats.

